{
  "provenance": {
    "source": "hand-authored",
    "date": "2026-08-31",
    "evidence": "changes/2026-08-31-auth-contract-draft.md; spec/auth.md AUTH-1, AUTH-7 (ratified 2026-08-31); changes/2026-09-01-credential-policy.md (xai cases); changes/2026-09-01-subscription-first.md (xai oauth-unless-explicit reorder, superseding the same-day key-then-oauth cases before any port consumed them); changes/2026-09-03-provider-registry.md (deepseek plain-key case: AUTH-1 key chain, registry-declared env key DEEPSEEK_API_KEY); changes/2026-09-03-zai-live.md (zai plain-key case, env key ZAI_API_KEY); changes/2026-09-03-deepseek-anthropic-live.md (a second provider string on the same env key); changes/2026-09-03-meta-live.md (meta / meta-chat / meta-anthropic: three provider strings on one env key META_API_KEY; Meta's own vendor-less MODEL_API_KEY is deliberately not read); changes/2026-09-03-moonshotai-live.md (moonshotai: two vendor-named env keys in declared order, MOONSHOTAI_API_KEY then MOONSHOT_API_KEY \u2014 the second is the name Moonshot's own docs use; the first shadows it when both are set); changes/2026-09-03-cloud-hosts.md (nine cloud-chain cases: AUTH-1 aws/azure/gcp chains in the SDK order pinned from research/cloud-hosts/10-facts-*.md, AUTH-7 `unprobed`, harness-materialized files under a sandbox HOME); changes/2026-09-03-moonshotai-wires.md (moonshotai-responses, moonshotai-anthropic: the same two env keys); changes/2026-09-09-python-migration-ux.md (AUTH-1 shared explicit keys; Python-first rollout); changes/2026-09-22-managed-authentication.md Ratification and fixture correction (AUTH-1/AUTH-15, R3: unusable xAI subscription blocks ambient key, not a rescue source); changes/2026-09-30-claude-code-client-version.md (oauth-fresh pins the default client_version backend setting; two claude-code cases pin its env and explicit origins, AUTH-10)"
  },
  "description": "Credential-resolution chain fixtures (spec/auth.md AUTH-1) exercised through each implementation's explain_auth equivalent (AUTH-7). Language-neutral: 'steps' name source kinds, not display strings. 'borrowed_file' is the provider's local OAuth credential file in its AUTH-8 wire format: a borrowed CLI store (claude-code, openai-codex) or the lm15-owned store (xai, oauth-unless-explicit policy). The sentinel below is planted as every secret value; no rendered report may contain it (AUTH-5). Cloud-chain cases (2026-09-03) carry 'files' (materialized by the harness under a sandbox HOME, '~/' relative) and optional 'settings'; 'unprobed' marks a configured network/subprocess rung the offline doctor did not contact, and 'configured' is true when a rung is selected OR unprobed.",
  "sentinel": "SECRET-SENTINEL-DO-NOT-PRINT",
